## 4. Current backend file structure

The project currently contains:

```text
BACKEND/
│
├── brain.py
├── build_vocabulary.py
├── context_engine.py
├── knowledge_engine.py
├── meaning_engine.py
├── reasoning_engine.py
├── reference_engine.py
├── sentence_interpreter.py
